},{"value":"gajae-code/open-weights-kimi-glm","name":"Kimi + GLM"},{"value":"gajae-code/open-weights-kimi-glm-deepseek","name":"Kimi + GLM + DeepSeek"},{"value":"gajae-code/open-weights-luna","name":"Luna"},{"value":"gajae-code/open-weights-spark","name":"Muse Spark"},{"value":"gajae-code/open-weights-spark-deepseek","name":"Muse Spark + DeepSeek"},{"value":"gajae-code/open-weights-spark-luna","name":"Muse Spark + Luna"},{"value":"gajae-code/opus-codex","name":"Opus + Codex"},{"value":"gajae-code/opus-luna","name":"opus-luna"},{"value":"gajae-code/ox-luna","name":"ox-luna"},{"value":"gajae-code/sol-luna","name":"sol-luna"},{"value":"gajae-code/ya","name":"ya"}],"type":"select","currentValue":"oci-opencodex/anthropic/claude-opus-5-5"},{"id":"thinking","name":"Thinking","category":"thought_level","options":[{"value":"off","name":"off"},{"value":"low","name":"low"},{"value":"medium","name":"medium"},{"value":"high","name":"high"},{"value":"xhigh","name":"xhigh"},{"value":"max","name":"max"}],"type":"select","currentValue":"medium"},{"id":"steeringMode","name":"Steering queue","options":[{"value":"all","name":"All"},{"value":"one-at-a-time","name":"One at a time"}],"type":"select","currentValue":"one-at-a-time"},{"id":"followUpMode","name":"Follow-up queue","options":[{"value":"all","name":"All"},{"value":"one-at-a-time","name":"One at a time"}],"type":"select","currentValue":"one-at-a-time"},{"id":"toolInterruptPolicy","name":"Tool interrupt policy","options":[{"value":"abort_tools","name":"Abort running tools"},{"value":"finish_tools","name":"Finish running tools"}],"type":"select","currentValue":"abort_tools"}],"modes":{"availableModes":[{"id":"default","name":"Default"},{"id":"plan","name":"Plan"}],"currentModeId":"default"}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"f33b3249-065b-4b18-9041-795784bd95b0","update":{"sessionUpdate":"available_commands_update","availableCommands":[{"name":"skill:career-portfolio","description":"국문+영문 이력서(CV)·포트폴리오·경력기술서·자소서를 사실 원장 하나에서 만들고 PDF/웹으로 렌더한 뒤 기계 게이트(텍스트층·글리프·분량·수치 대조·기밀·국영 정합·JD 커버리지)로 검증하는 스킬. 내부망 대시보드(:8872)로 편집·빌드·검사·미리보기. Use when: 외국계·국내 대기업 지원서류, 엔지니어→AI 직무 전환 포트폴리오, 이력서 PDF 제작, 자소서 글자수 확인, 경력기술서 작성 요청.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:critique-loop","description":"Make Claude watch its own frames: critique.mjs evidence, harsh 7-axis scores, timestamped P0/P1/P2 problems in docs/review_log.md, fix the 3 worst, re-check, pass the gate. Use for 'critique it', 'review the frames', 'is it good'.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:director-brief","description":"Plan long-form or overnight films: director's brief (PLAN FIRST or GO, budget, definition of done), ANIMATION_GUIDE + STORYBOARD, chapter subagents, gates, chunked render. Use for 'overnight film', 'music video', '2-minute film'.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:free-ai-rotation","description":"무료 AI 모델을 다계정 키 로테이션 + 쿼터 폴백으로 굴리는 인프라(nim/opencode-zen/tokenrouter 로테이터, free-ai-registry SSOT, commander-ng 폴백 체인)를 운영·확장·진단할 때 사용. 새 무료 계정/프로바이더 편입, 429·쿼터 소진 진단, 소비자 설정 재렌더, free-gjc 검증에 쓴다. 라우팅 로직 자체를 LLM이 흉내내는 용도가 아니다.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:gjc-quest","description":"gjc를 쓰다 마주친 결함을 \"퀘스트\"로 띄워 수락 여부를 사람이 정하게 하고, 오너 방향에 맞는 것만 남겨 상위 등급은 `gjc crash report` 공식 경로로, 하위 등급은 완성된 PR을 제안서로 보내는 절차. 보장되는 것은 수동 호출뿐이며, 수락과 제출은 항상 사람이 한다. 사용자가 \"gjc quest\", \"quest scan\", \"scan gjc defects\", \"gjc 퀘스트\", \"결함 퀘스트\", \"퀘스트\", \"/gjc-quest\", \"기여할 거 있나\", \"퀘스트 스캔\", \"이거 PR 낼까\" 라고 할 때 쓴다. 원격 상태를 바꾸는 일은 전부 사람에게 넘긴다.\n","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:hancharacter","description":"번역에서 캐릭터 말투(役割語/말투 어미)가 뭉개지는 것을 기계적으로 잡는다. 원문 캐릭터의 말투 표지를 측정해 계약으로 봉인하고, 번역이 그 목소리를 지웠거나(LOSS) 없던 걸 만들어냈으면(INVENTION) 거부한다. 자막·PO·XLIFF·CSV·EPUB·ASS 등 실제 파일을 읽는다. 게임/만화/웹툰/자막/소설 번역의 캐릭터 목소리 보존을 검사·집행할 때, 또는 기존 번역의 말투 일관성을 감사할 때 사용. Enforces character voice (speech style, role language) preservation in a translation, and produces the verdict that the `hanpatch` game/ROM localisation pipeline's voice gate consumes — load this alongside `hanpatch` whenever a title declares a `voice_contract`, or when auditing an existing fan translation for flattened or fabricated speech style.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:hanpatch","description":"Build a fan translation patch for a game ROM with structural consistency gates — extract text, machine-translate through free endpoints, enforce a glossary and text-box capacity, seal a manifest, verify with an independent multi-judge QA panel, inject, and prove the round trip. Use when asked to localise/한글패치 a game, or to audit an existing translation pipeline.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:ip-as-logo","description":"Generate highly simplified personified IP mascot logos with Flat-first geometry, rounded heavy forms, two purposeful IP colors over one solid background color, and ultra-light neo-skeuomorphic internal modeling. Use when creating an animal, creature, robot, ghost, plant, object, or other character as a minimal square logo or app-icon artwork, including when the agent should infer three product-relevant directions and propose six independent candidates for approval.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:krpatch","description":"롬(ROM)·게임 한글화·한글패치 단일 진입점 — 롬 한글화, 게임 번역, 한글패치 제작·감사·배포를 하나의 원장에서 끝낸다. 컨테이너를 전수 조사해 누락을 구조적으로 막고, 폰트로 렌더되는 텍스트만 아니라 텍스처·이미지·로고에 구워진 일본어도 탐지해 함께 완결한다. hanpatch(스크립트·폰트)·texture-logo-kr(구워진 그래픽)·hancharacter(말투 게이트)·krpatch-publish(배포)·emucap/retro-kr-patch(런타임 증거)를 순서와 인수 기준으로 묶는다. Single entry point for game ROM localisation and fan translation — exhaustive container census so no surface is silently skipped, then both font-rendered text and text baked into textures, images and logos, gated and released from one ledger. 이럴 때 사용: 이 롬 한글화해줘, 게임 한글패치 만들어줘, 패치에 일본어 남아있는지 남았는지 전수 확인·검사, 미번역 외국어 찾기, 이미지·텍스처·로고에 박힌 글자 탐지, localise this rom, korean patch for this game, audit an existing patch for missed text.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:krpatch-publish","description":"Publish conventional downloadable Korean fan patches to krpatch.duckdns.org — BPS for GBA, file-level BPS/xdelta ZIP for PC RomForge 3DS repack. Prove native consumer application and independent asset readback, register data/games.json, run tools/verify_downloads.py, and operate feedback. HPK is internal-only, not a public release format.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:motion-reel","description":"Make a launch video, app or product reel, explainer or motion ad from code, end to end: brand assets from a URL, beat-grid shot list, synced sound, critique loop, all formats. Default for new video requests; not footage edits.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:pptx-workshop","description":"임원/워크샵 보고용 PPTX 작업 스킬. 회사 표준 양식(26년 하반기 임원 워크샵 덱)을 SSOT 템플릿으로 사용해 새 덱 생성·양식 재조립·텍스트 치환·시각 QA를 수행한다. 트리거: 워크샵/워크숍 PPT, 임원 보고 덱, 표준 양식 pptx, 초안 양식 변환, 슬라이드 제작·수정, .pptx 편집 요청 전반.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:product-reel","description":"Brand-asset stage of a product film (motion-reel runs the whole film): capture real screenshots, logo, colors and fonts from a URL, never redraw UI; brand story beats; voice + mascot. Use to grab or fix a brand's assets.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:reference-style","description":"Turn a reference (a frame, a video or an image library) into docs/style_guide.md and a beat-grid shot list: measure cuts, palette and pace, take grammar not content, wait for OK. Use when the user supplies or names a look.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:seek-engine","description":"Build, debug or speed up the seek(t) render engine: render contract, canvas vs page capture, workers/subframes/chunks, determinism fixes, Remotion or HyperFrames handoff. Use for 'render is slow', 'frames differ', 'use Remotion'.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:shapr-agent","description":"Parametric CAD modeling through the shapr-agent MCP server (cad_* tools) or its Python SDK — sketches, extrudes, fillets, booleans, patterns, measurement, STEP/STL/3MF/GLB export. Use when the user asks to model, edit, measure or export a 3D part.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:ship-formats","description":"Ship every format from one timeline, then package it: layout() reframing (never crop), render all formats, per-format checks, deliver.mjs, a brand skill, a service offer. Use for 'export 9:16 and 16:9', 'deliver', 'make a skill'.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:showreel","description":"The viral one-line 'showreel for a résumé' prompt: why it works (anatomy), the credited quote, and seeded variants that avoid look-alike reels; runs it as an engine test. Use for that prompt, its variations, or a showreel.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:sound-design","description":"Score a film to its beat grid: measure a track (beats.mjs) or synthesize one (score.mjs), cue SFX from the film, add voice, mix to -14 LUFS / -1 dBTP at exact length. Use for 'add music', 'sync to the beat', 'SFX', 'loudness'.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:springs","description":"Make motion feel physical with closed-form springs from lib/motion.js: presets, springFromFeel, track() for multi-target values, loopTrack loops, indicators, text swaps. Use for 'feels linear', 'add bounce', 'easing to springs'.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:stockshorts","description":"실제 주식 기사와 지표를 스토리 콘티가 있는 동화형 모션그래픽 Shorts로 제작한다. 인수 없이는 A/B/C 인터뷰부터 시작하며, 스킬 수정·콘티만 요청하면 제작하지 않는다. 사실과 시각적 비유를 분리하고 승인된 음성·레이아웃·기밀 유지 및 실제 영상 검증 계약을 지킨다.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:studio-init","description":"Scaffold a motion-studio film project (seek(t) renderer, springs, beat grid, synthesized sound, critique tools), install it, set up the browser, run doctor. Use for 'set up the motion studio', 'new film project', 'init studio'.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:texture-logo-kr","description":"롬 파일 안의 게임 로고(텍스처 에셋·텍스처 폰트)를 원본 스타일을 보존하며 한글화하는 파이프라인. texture-kr MCP(tex_scan/extract/segment/redraw/quantize/compose/inject/verify/review_export)와 이미지 생성 도구를 오케스트레이션한다. 로고 한글화, 텍스처 한글화, 롬 그래픽 번역 요청에 사용.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:ui-morph-spec","description":"Write a six-part XML state spec for a one-shape UI morph film (inputs, direction, structure, build, gotchas, start): states on downbeats, cursor-driven changes, seamless loop, approval gate. Use for 'UI morph', 'state list'.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:deep-interview","description":"Socratic deep interview with mathematical ambiguity gating before explicit execution approval","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:ralplan","description":"Consensus planning entrypoint that auto-gates vague ultragoal requests before execution","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:autoresearch","description":"Goal-directed research missions interleaving web and data evidence into a structured verdict","input":{"hint":"[request]"}},{"name":"skill:ultragoal","description":"Create and execute durable repo-native multi-goal plans over GJC goal mode artifacts.","input":{"hint":"[request]"}}]}}}
